      "message": "I was originally thinking of defaults, e.g. \n\ncc_binary -\u003e custom_cc_defaults_foo -\u003e custom_cc_defaults_bar, and custom_cc_defaults_foo and custom_cc_defaults_bar both have soong_config_variables under the same namespace.\n\n...but, we shouldn\u0027t be keeping both s_c_v structs in the list, but instead merge them like they\u0027re done for non-s_c_v props today. Will remove the list.",
