      "writtenOn": "2021-11-08T12:44:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can this be made even simpler?\n\nMy understanding is that there is only ever one setNamespacedVariableProps() call to each module instance and its argument is always a map with one key-value pair, which means that the map[string]{}interface structure will have only one key-value pair.\n\nIf that\u0027s so, why make it a map? If not, why am I wrong?",
