      "writtenOn": "2021-11-08T13:37:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s for defaults and multiple namespace support. e.g if `cc_lib` depends on `foo_cc_defaults` and `bar_cc_defaults`, with both default modules being custom config module types contributing to a different namespace, they need to be stored as a map. Each defaults can also transitively depend on other defaults.\n\nYou can see `TestSoongConfigModuleType_MultipleNamespaces` https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/build/soong/+/1878095/15/bp2build/soong_config_module_type_conversion_test.go",
      "parentUuid": "e296bba2_966c0931",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 440,
